          <li><strong>Volume Discount:</strong> 20% Retainer Discount for 12 items = -$240.00</li>
          <li><strong>Discounted Subtotal:</strong> $960.00</li>
          <li><strong>Paid Ad Licensing:</strong> +20% for 30-day monthly ad rights = +$192.00</li>
